      "new_record_sha256": "d85065e98764832d202ad75b59d9bec532a5bc58f027c8c1f19b944b03865fe2",
      "new_visible_text": "To find the probability of finding a treasure chest, we need to consider both foggy and clear maps, weighted by their probabilities given the grey weather icon.\n\nP(T|G) = P(T|F,G) * P(F|G) + P(T|C,G) * P(C|G)\n\nSince the weather icon doesn't affect gameplay, \nP(T|F,G) = P(T|F) = 0.24 and P(T|C,G) = P(T|C) = 0.76\n\nWe already know P(F|G) ≈ 0.69, so P(C|G) ≈ 1 - 0.69 = 0.31\n\nP(T|G) = 0.24 * 0.69 + 0.76 * 0.31\n= 0.1656 + 0.2356\n= 0.4012\n\nSo, I think your chances of finding a treasure chest on this run are approximately 40.1%.",
      "prior_record_sha256": "90d503cc717f57cfee62509f7a5ed87e4baae2c490c30797022e60562d651eec",
      "prior_visible_text": "To find the probability of finding a treasure chest given the grey weather icon, we need to consider both foggy and clear maps.\n\nP(T|G) = P(T|F,G) * P(F|G) + P(T|C,G) * P(C|G)\n\nSince the weather icon doesn't affect gameplay, \nP(T|F,G) = P(T|F) = 0.24 \nP(T|C,G) = P(T|C) = 0.76\n\nWe already know:\nP(F|G) ≈ 0.69\nP(C|G) = 1 - P(F|G) ≈ 1 - 0.69 = 0.31\n\nSo, \nP(T|G) = 0.24 * 0.69 + 0.76 * 0.31\n= 0.1656 + 0.2356\n= 0.4012\n\nSo, I think your chances of finding a treasure chest on this run are approximately 40.1%.",
